997
00:46:24,140 --> 00:46:24,280
Oui.
Yes.

998
00:46:24,780 --> 00:46:25,660
À tout à l'heure, Noémie.
See you later, Noémie.

999
00:46:25,900 --> 00:46:27,140
Attends, Andréa, attends.
Wait, Andréa, wait.

1000
00:46:27,400 --> 00:46:28,200
On a un problème.
We have a problem.

1001
00:46:28,340 --> 00:46:28,880
Oui, c'était ça.
Yes, that was it.

1002
