1009
00:46:44,810 --> 00:46:45,370
C'est le grand néon.
It's the big neon sign.

1010
00:46:45,690 --> 00:46:46,330
Et alors ?
And?

1011
00:46:46,330 --> 00:46:48,290
Et alors, on a réussi à le faire fonctionner,
And, well, we managed to get it working,

1012
00:46:48,310 --> 00:46:50,050
sauf que, voilà, il y a eu un court-circuit
except there was a short circuit

1013
00:46:50,050 --> 00:46:52,030
et certains des invités ont un petit peu vu les 36 chandelles.
and some of the guests saw stars.

1014
00:46:52,290 --> 00:46:52,970
C'était quoi ?
What was that?

1015
00:46:52,970 --> 00:46:53,850
Non, mais attendez.
No, but hold on.

1016
00:46:53,890 --> 00:46:55,490
Oui, oui, il y a des blessés, c'est quoi, là ?
Yes, yes, there are people hurt — what's going on?

1017
00:46:56,130 --> 00:46:57,430
C'est pour ça que nous n'avons pas compris
That's why we didn't understand

1018
00:46:57,430 --> 00:46:58,630
de quoi vous nous accusiez,
what you were accusing us of,

1019
00:46:58,690 --> 00:46:59,910
puisque, comme vous le savez,
since, as you know,

1020
00:47:00,810 --> 00:47:01,870
Isabelle Huppert ne pouvait pas tourner
Isabelle Huppert couldn't shoot

1021
00:47:01,870 --> 00:47:03,490
dans un autre film cette nuit-là,
in another film that night,

1022
00:47:03,870 --> 00:47:06,950
