given that she was at her son's wedding.

1023
00:47:08,550 --> 00:47:11,390
Et donc, nous avons une photo, là, de la soirée.
And so, we have a photo, here, from the evening.

1024
00:47:11,690 --> 00:47:14,470
Avec sa brue, sa nouvelle brue, voilà.
With his daughter-in-law, his new daughter-in-law, there you go.

1025
00:47:14,630 --> 00:47:15,590
D'autant, elle l'a ouf.
Especially since she's crazy about him.

1026
00:47:18,170 --> 00:47:20,050
Voilà, il paraît qu'ils ont passé une excellente soirée,
Right, apparently they had a wonderful evening,

1027
00:47:20,050 --> 00:47:21,470
que c'était très...
it was very...

1028
00:47:21,470 --> 00:47:23,890
Voilà, donc, il s'agit d'un énorme malentendu.
