1029
00:47:23,930 --> 00:47:25,250
It's a huge misunderstanding.
It's a huge misunderstanding.

1030
00:47:26,050 --> 00:47:27,890
Oui, parce que Isabelle Huppert était bien
Yes, because Isabelle Huppert was indeed

1031
00:47:27,890 --> 00:47:29,990
sur le tournage de Marie de Médicis cette nuit-là,
on the set of Marie de Médicis that night,

1032
00:47:30,510 --> 00:47:32,630
mais pas Isabelle Huppert, sa cliente.
but not Isabelle Huppert, her client.

1033
00:47:32,630 --> 00:47:33,090
Non, non.
No, no.

1034
