C'était Isabelle Huppert, ma cliente.
It was Isabelle Huppert, my client.

1035
00:47:37,210 --> 00:47:37,610
Hello.
Hello.

1036
00:47:39,130 --> 00:47:39,530
Hi.
Hi.

1037
